        "congressionalglo00unit:488:par_000488_000023": {
          "text": "Mr. POMEROY. I believe the pending question is on the amendment that I submit- ted. I have conversed with very many of the members of the Pacific Railroad Committee, and as they desire to report upon this proposi- tion separately, not connected with this bill, I do not desire to press it against the wishes of the friends of this measure and of our rail- roads. I will therefore withdraw the amend-",
